    "text": "The sum of all real roots of equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is",
