  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp; so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, the given equation becomes,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(or)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(or)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(or) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(or)&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(or)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(or)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>But,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; Only possible values for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;(or)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; The sum of roots of given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></math>.</p>",
